msgid ""
"POSIX.1-2001 specifies only the B<LOG_USER> and B<LOG_LOCAL*> values for "
"I<facility>.  However, with the exception of B<LOG_AUTHPRIV> and B<LOG_FTP>, "
"the other I<facility> values appear on most UNIX systems."
